# numeratorDenominator

- _numeratorDenominator(n/d)_

Answer a `List` of the numerator and denominator of the `Fraction` _n/d_.

```
>>> 1/3.numeratorDenominator
[1L 3L]

>>> 1/3.components
[1 3]
```

* * *

See also: Fraction, List

